<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">văpōrātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		vaporo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a steaming</i>, <i>reeking</i>, <i>steam</i>, <i>vapor</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inundantium aquarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 6, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urinae impubium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 6, 18, § 65</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">balinearum,</span>”
				<i>a steam-bath</i>, <i>vapor-bath</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 4, 14, § 55</span></i>
			.—Esp., <i>a fomentation</i>, <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Acut. 1, 17, 171 al.</span></i></div>
